  "Pages currently open in Antigravity's Browser instance are shown below.": "當前在 Antigravity 瀏覽器例項中開啟的頁面如下。",
  "Performs 3D structural searches of proteins against various databases (PDB, AlphaFold, CATH, MGnify, etc.) using the Foldseek API. Use ONLY when the user provides a physical 3D coordinate file (.cif, .mmcif, or .pdb) and wants to find structurally similar proteins. Do NOT use if the user only provides a protein sequence, gene name, or UniProt ID.": "使用 Foldseek API 對各種資料庫進行蛋白質 3D 結構搜尋。僅當使用者提供物理 3D 座標檔案並想要尋找結構相似的蛋白質時使用。如果使用者僅提供蛋白質序列、基因名稱或 UniProt ID，請勿使用。",
  "Performs multiple sequence alignment of proteins with EBI Clustal Omega. Use when you need to align multiple sequences to assess similarity, domain conservation, or key residue conservation. Supports up to 4000 sequences and a maximum file size of 4 MB. Do not use to search for homologous proteins in a database (use MMseqs2, BLAST), align non-protein sequences (DNA, RNA), perform structural alignment (use Foldseek, PyMOL), or if you only have a single sequence.": "使用 EBI Clustal Omega 執行蛋白質多序列比全。當需要比對多條序列以評估相似性、結構域保守性或關鍵殘基保守性時使用。最多支援 4000 條序列，最大檔案 4 MB。請勿用於在資料庫中搜尋同源蛋白質、比對非蛋白質序列、執行結構比對，或者當你只有一條序列時。",
  "Please describe the issue in detail. The more actionable your feedback, the quicker our team can address your request. Some helpful information includes:": "請詳細描述您遇到的問題。您的回饋越具體，我們的團隊就能越快處理您的請求。一些有助於解決問題的資訊包括：",
  "Predict the location of your next edit": "預測下一次編輯的位置",
  "Predict the location of your next edit and navigates you there with a tab keypress.": "預測您下一次編輯的位置，並按 Tab 鍵導覽至該處。",
  "Preview": "預覽",
  "Provide read and write access to directories on the local filesystem.": "提供對本機檔案系統目錄的讀取和寫入權限。",
  "Purchase Credits": "購買點數",
  "Query Open Targets Platform for target-disease associations, drug target discovery, tractability/safety data, genetics/omics evidence, known drugs, for therapeutic target identification.": "查詢 Open Targets 平臺以獲取靶點-疾病關聯、藥物靶點發現、成藥性/安全性資料、遺傳學/組學證據、已知藥物，用於治療性靶點識別。",
  "Query the ENCODE Registry of cis-Regulatory Elements (cCREs) via the SCREEN GraphQL API, or make custom queries to the ENCODE Portal REST API for experiments and files (ChIP-seq peaks, etc.). Use when you want to query regulatory annotations or raw experimental data across human cell types.": "透過 SCREEN GraphQL API 查詢 ENCODE 順式調控元件 (cCREs) 登錄檔，或對 ENCODE 門戶 REST API 進行自定義查詢以獲取實驗和檔案。當你想要查詢跨人類細胞型別的調控註釋或原始實驗資料時使用。",
  "Query the JASPAR database for Transcription Factor (TF) binding profiles. Use when retrieving Position Frequency Matrices (PFMs) or Position Weight Matrices (PWMs) for specific TFs, resolving gene symbols to JASPAR Matrix IDs, or getting TF metadata. Supports multiple output formats (MEME, TRANSFAC, PFM, JASPAR, YAML).": "查詢 JASPAR 資料庫以獲取轉錄因子 (TF) 結合譜。在為特定 TF 檢索位置頻率矩陣 (PFM) 或位置權重矩陣 (PWM)、將基因符號解析為 JASPAR 矩陣 ID，或獲取 TF 後設資料時使用。",
  "Query the QuickGO and Evidence & Conclusion Ontology (ECO) REST API. Use this when you need to map genes to biological processes, molecular functions, or cellular components, find genes associated with a specific pathway/GO term, or explore the Gene Ontology hierarchy. Do not use for querying drug targets (use OpenTargets) or mechanistic signaling pathway diagrams (use KEGG).": "查詢 QuickGO 和證據與結論本體論 (ECO) REST API。當你需要將基因對映到生物學過程、分子功能或細胞組分，尋找與特定通路/GO 術語相關的基因，或探索 Gene Ontology 層級時使用。請勿用於查詢藥物靶點或機制訊號通路圖。",
  "Query, search, and download data from the openFDA API for drugs, devices, foods, tobacco, cosmetics, animal and veterinary products, substances, and transparency data. Use for FDA adverse events, recalls, labeling, approvals, shortages, 510(k) clearances, NDC lookups, and any FDA safety or regulatory data query across all 28 API endpoints.": "從 openFDA API 查詢、搜尋並下載藥物、器械、食品、菸草、化妝品、動物及獸醫產品、物質以及透明度資料。用於跨越全部 28 個 API 端點查詢 FDA 的不良事件、召回、標籤、批准、短缺、510(k) 許可、NDC 查詢及任何 FDA 安全或監管資料。",
